{"id":"uniquement","lemma":"uniquement","pos":"adv","rank":1645,"glosses":["uniquely","only; exclusively; solely","merely; only; just"],"ipa":"/y.nik.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/13/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-uniquement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-uniquement.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Uniquement de l'eau, je vous prie.","en":"Just water, please.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2474","words":[null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to pray","l":"prier"}]},{"text":"Puis-je acheter uniquement les lentilles ?","en":"Can I buy only the lenses?","words":[{"g":"then"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to purchase"},null,{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"lens","l":"lentille"}]},{"text":"Tom boit uniquement du café.","en":"The only thing that Tom drinks is coffee.","words":[null,{"g":"to drink","l":"boire"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"coffee"}]},{"text":"Je le fais uniquement parce que je suis obligé de le faire.","en":"I'm only doing it because I'm forced to.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null,null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"obligated"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"because"]]},{"text":"Tom fait ça uniquement lorsqu'il est fatigué.","en":"Tom only does that when he's tired.","words":[null,{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"that"},null,null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"tired"}]}]}